{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47108","headline":"将欲再游荆渚留辞岐下司徒 · 尚颜","name":"将欲再游荆渚留辞岐下司徒","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"竹锡铜瓶配衲衣，殷公楼畔偶然离。\n白莲几看从开日，明月长吟到落时。\n活计本无桑柘润，疎慵寻有水云资。\n今朝回去精神别，爲得头厅宰相诗。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"尚颜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47108.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47108","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}